  <Text 880 700 18 #0000ff 0 "Calculating Degeneration Resistor Value">
  <Text 890 740 12 #000000 0 "From this curve, at half the supply voltage (V_{G} = V_{DD}/2)\nThe voltage across the current source is 0.205 V.\n~\nAlso, at that input voltage, current sinked by the VCCS is\n3 uA.\n~\nTherefore, R_{source} = 0.205/3e-6 = 68.3 kΩ\n~\nR_{source} ~ 70 kΩ (Rounded to nearest value)">
